&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI we’re always looking for extraordinary people who thrive on making an extraordinary impact. Right now we’re looking for a Director of Marketing Operations to oversee the Marketing Ops team based in London. If that’s you, and making a difference gets you out of bed in the morning, keep reading. It could be the start of something, well, extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;As our Director of Marketing Operations you’ll:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the people that are the engine that improves the efficiency and performance of our Growth Marketing team. Marketing Ops at GWI is a growth engine, not a service function. Reporting to the VP Growth Marketing and as a member of our Marketing Leadership team, you’ll have real influence and be expected to identify and drive initiatives that have an impact on pipeline and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things you’ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading and mentoring two direct reports. You’ll own the prioritisation and delivery of the MOps roadmap, ensuring your team are working on the highest impact projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of our entire marketing tech stack, including assessing new tech, budget ownership, vendor management, and rationalising the stack when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The lead and account lifecycle. You will be responsible for lead and account scoring and ensuring actionable intent signals are surfaced to Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data governance and quality in all tooling. You’ll work closely with RevOps to ensure data is syncing seamlessly in Salesforce and Hubspot.&lt;/li&gt;
