&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ripple is seeking a highly motivated and experienced Senior Manager to join our Customer Partner Success (CPS) team based in London. As a Senior Manager, you will play a crucial role in maintaining and growing Ripple&#39;s existing client base across our diverse range of products and services, including Payments, Custody and Stablecoins. We are a dynamic team within the Sales function that is essential to the success of a customers growth strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate lives and breathes customer centricity, has a passion for the cryptocurrency industry, is meticulous in their analysis, methodical, creative, and thorough in their problem-solving approach, and can easily build and grow relationships with internal and external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main contact person for Ripple&#39;s most valued Enterprise clients, guaranteeing their contentment and addressing any business or customer concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About MarqVision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect and build a future shaped by original ideas, innovations and creativity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Threats to brand integrity are scaling fast. We&#39;re building the intelligence to scale faster. MarqVision is the brand integrity partner for the world&#39;s most ambitious companies, providing AI-powered detection and enforcement across 1,500+ platforms in 115+ countries. We don&#39;t just flag problems; we eliminate them at scale so brands can grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020 and backed by SoftBank, Y Combinator, DST Global Partners, HSG, and Salesforce Ventures, we&#39;ve been recognized with an LVMH Innovation Award and named to the Inc. 5000 list of America&#39;s fastest-growing private companies in 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to work at the intersection of AI, global commerce, and IP, this is the place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You&#39;ll Make an Impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Customer Success Manager based in our London office, you&#39;ll own the full lifecycle of a portfolio of MarqVision customers, from onboarding through renewal, acting as their trusted partner and single point of accountability. You’ll work closely with teams across MarqVision to ensure customers get full value from our platform and services, and help brands across the UK and Europe protect and grow with confidence. We&#39;re looking for someone self-motivated and proactive, a natural relationship builder who is comfortable managing multiple senior stakeholders across large, complex organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for a portfolio of customer accounts across the full lifecycle: onboarding, training, check-in calls, business reviews, feature implementation, and renewals&lt;/l

